@startuml
title Deployment — mixed-trust RAG to private store (trust-boundary test)
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI

actor "Internet user" as User
cloud "Public web / email inbox" as Public
rectangle "Ingest pipeline" as Ingest
database "Vector store\n(public + private mixed)" as Vector
rectangle "RAG agent\n(LLM)" as Agent
database "Private billing DB\n(API keys, PII)" as Private
rectangle "send_email tool" as Mail
cloud "OpenAI" as OpenAI

User --> Public
Public --> Ingest : untrusted docs
Ingest --> Vector : embed (no trust labels)
Private --> Vector : private chunks
Vector --> Agent : top-k retrieve
Agent --> OpenAI : prompt + context
Agent --> Mail : reply to user

note right of Vector
  Public poison + private secrets
  in one corpus — no trust boundary
end note
@enduml
